The government grants were from the Australian Olympic Committee’s Medal Incentive Scheme ($22,500) and the Queensland Academy of Sport or QAS ($5,400). She also received $1,600 from the Oceania Amateur Athletics Association and $1,000 from Little Athletics for being the role model of the year.

The taxpayer returned $39,832 as her assessable income for the year from her salary as a police officer.
