7. Special rules
The special rules may determine:
•	who is required to lodge a GST return
•	when you lodge a GST return
•	who must pay any GST owed
•	when GST is paid
•	who gets a refund.
Part 4-7 of the GST Act contains most of the special rules for returns, payments and refunds, and is in fact titled ‘special rules mainly about returns, payments and refunds’. However, there are provisions providing for special rules elsewhere in the GST Act.
Section 31-99 lists the special rules about GST returns.
Section 33-99 lists the special rules about payments of GST.
Section 35-99 lists the special rules about refunds.
