Scenario 5 – SMSF meeting obligations
The Happy Super Fund has been selected for audit as an Auditor Contravention Report (ACR) has been lodged.
You contact the trustee for an initial conversation prior to sending an audit notification letter.
Chris, the Trustee agrees that the contraventions reported by the Fund’s auditor occurred and you discuss the total amount of penalties imposed under the law.
