When you receive loan documents, confirm:
• The documents are in the name of the client
• Do they confirm what was purchased?
• Is the amount of the loan of sufficient size to either fund the specific purchase or fund the business’ purchases as a whole?
Note: a loan document is NOT a substitute for a tax invoice.
