Hamish has recently taken up part-time Uber driving. He still works full-time at a local printing and labelling factory on a 24 hour rotating 
shift. For the past 5 years his salary has been approx. $65,000 pa. His intention is to eventually drive full-time for Uber as his enjoys the 
