Hamish still lives at home with his parents, rarely goes out and saves money at every opportunity he can. When he started Uber driving he 
used his savings to buy a luxury Lexus for $44,000. He reckons he got a great deal, sourcing the seller via carsales.com.au.
The seller told him he had recently re-structured his hire car business and no longer needed the vehicle. The seller supplied him with a tax 
