Hamish only uses his Lexus for Uber driving as he likes to keep it in good condition for his customers. Hamish uses his older Toyota Camry 
for all other travel including travel to and from his full-time job.
When Hamish setup for Uber driving he referred to the ATO website links to ensure he was meeting all his tax obligations. He registered & 
