Indicators of suspected third party fraud
The client confirms that they did not lodge/amend the activity statement, income tax return or amendment.
The client confirms that the have not registered for an ABN and GST role.
The client denies any knowledge of changes to contact details and other digital records.
Financial institution account (FIA) and/or the client’s contact details have changed/updated same day or around the same time of the BAS lodgement. 
BAS lodgement pattern. Example: Prior BAS were lodged in payable now suddenly the new BAS are in a refundable position. 
The refunds of multiple clients are being directed to a particular bank account which is not that of an authorised agent.
The client advises personal details have been stolen (and may have formally reported as stolen to the authorities).
