Profiling tips
Gather intel and information from ATO systems – Siebel, ICP, ECP, RAPT, income tax returns (ITR) lodged and:
• View the client’s related entities in Siebel by selecting the Relationship tab in the Client Consolidated View (CCV) in Siebel
• Check for Inbound or Outbound activities (reported) to indicate the clients or their related entity’s identity has been compromised
