GST-free sales vs Input Tax supplies
The GST Act defines which supplies are GST-free, and which supplies are input taxed.
GST- Free - Division 38 lists supplies that are GST-free and describes when they are GST-free.
There are products and services which are GST-free and are exempt from GST. 
Input tax supply - Division 40 lists supplies that are input taxed and describes when they are input taxed.
Input-taxed sales are sales of goods and services that don't include GST in the price. You can't claim GST credits for 
the GST included in the price of your 'inputs’. 
INTERNAL
