Who we are and what we do
Here in Small Business, we see ourselves as stewards of the tax system and the small business client experience. Our goal is to 
support our clients in meeting their obligations and help them get it right from the start. The Australian small business 
population is made up of more than 2.6 million small businesses1, and we are committed to understanding their actions, needs 
and challenges.
