Support across Small Business
INTERNAL 13
Small Business Operational 
Improvement
Our Small Business Operational Improvement (SBOI) team connects 
across Small Business and the broader ATO to support operational 
requirements, including GST risks relevant to small business. 
SBOI is responsible for maintaining the inventory of Small Business 
procedures in EKM, along with letter, email, and SMS templates, and 
externally published forms. 
The team develops, maintains and improve our procedures, streamlines 
work processes, and drives automation and innovation across the 
business line. 
Small Business Toolset
The Small Business Toolset is a support resource available to all 
Small Business staff. 
It provides access to resources, templates, guides, and recordings 
designed to help you build and strengthen your skills and capabilities. 
You’ll find induction packs, recordings of past technical and soft-skill 
sessions, staff engagement events, and more. 
